    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 194 of the Inland Revenue Act, No. 24 of 2017, I, Mangala Samaraweera,Minister of Finance and Mass Media, do by this order prescribe, for the purpose of section 85 as in the regulation hereto.These regulations are effective from April 1, 2018.",
